{"term": {"label": "智", "occurrences": 2, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-ii", "title": "萬章下", "description": "孟子曰：「伯夷，目不視惡色，耳不聽惡聲。非其君不事，非其民不使。治則進，亂則退。橫政之所出，橫民之所止，不忍居也。思與鄉人處，如以朝衣朝冠坐於塗炭也。當紂之時，居北海之濱，以待天下之清也。故聞伯夷之風者，頑夫廉，懦夫有立志。\n「伊尹曰：『何事非君？何使非民？』治亦進，亂亦進。曰：『天之生斯民也，使先知覺後知，使先覺覺後"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "云", "id": "云"}, {"form": "何", "id": "何"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "聖", "id": "聖"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.7419373447293773, "source": "君", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 0.9062403960206536, "source": "君", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 1.9459101490553132, "source": "云", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 0.4054651081081644, "source": "何", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 0.8574502318512216, "source": "何", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 0.8574502318512216, "source": "何", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.0986122886681098, "source": "使", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 0.9315582040049435, "source": "使", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 3.044522437723423, "source": "事", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 2.3513752571634776, "source": "事", "target": "聖"}, {"weight": 1.0986122886681098, "source": "事", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.9459101490553132, "source": "事", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.1727202608218317, "source": "事", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 0.9315582040049435, "source": "王", "target": "子"}]}}